WEBVTT

00:00:15.060 --> 00:00:21.450
Ootani... Ootani...

00:00:22.530 --> 00:00:25.960
Ootani... Furukawa...

00:00:25.960 --> 00:00:31.830
Ootani... Ootani...

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:37.600
And... Ootani...

00:00:38.030 --> 00:00:48.640
Ootani... Ootani...

00:02:29.830 --> 00:02:31.010
And there you have it.

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.380
Having counted the votes,

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:37.550
we have determined that the alien fighter for the Camellia class is Yuri Ootani.

00:02:37.880 --> 00:02:40.510
N-No...!

00:02:40.920 --> 00:02:46.840
Let's put the names of those who were elected for some class position on the back wall.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:51.980
My last year of elementary school is going to be the worst.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:03:00.900
This isn't fair.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:04.870
Everyone just wanted me to do it because they didn't want to.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:08.330
I kinda envy you myself.

00:03:08.740 --> 00:03:10.800
Miyu...

00:03:11.010 --> 00:03:12.690
You can't blame me.

00:03:12.690 --> 00:03:15.630
You can skip cleaning duties, and you don't have to do homework.

00:03:15.820 --> 00:03:20.260
And you can miss classes when there's alien trouble, right?

00:03:23.110 --> 00:03:25.400
But still...

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:31.140
I kinda envy you myself.

00:03:31.400 --> 00:03:35.980
Easy for Miyu to say, she's not in my position.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.740
This is it.

00:03:55.910 --> 00:03:58.090
Uh... hiya...

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:00.970
You made it.

00:04:04.910 --> 00:04:09.230
I'll fill you in, now that you're all here.

00:04:09.230 --> 00:04:14.320
My name is Megumi Hisakawa, and I'm the leader of the Alien Counter-Measure Party.

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:16.820
From today onwards for the next year,

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:21.690
you'll be alien fighters here at the No. 9 Elementary School.

00:04:23.340 --> 00:04:24.660
Congratulations!

00:04:25.220 --> 00:04:26.870
What's so good about it...?

00:04:27.290 --> 00:04:30.580
Now, these guys are called Borgs.

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:33.500
They're symbiotic aliens.

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:36.460
You understand what "symbiotic" means, right?

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:44.150
I know.

00:04:44.150 --> 00:04:47.640
Unlike parasites, they rely on a give-and-take relationship.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.950
Correct.

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:55.920
In other words, wearing these on your head will ensure you're protected from danger.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.110
I knew I wasn't going to like this.

00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:10.700
See?

00:05:10.700 --> 00:05:12.910
Once you get used to it, it's no big deal.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.450
Oh, that reminds me.

00:05:14.450 --> 00:05:18.170
Next Saturday, I'll be coming to visit each of you at your homes.

00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:20.580
Don't forget to mention it to your parents.

00:05:24.800 --> 00:05:27.380
Miss Ootani...!

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:38.400
Miss Ootani!

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.570
This stinks.

00:05:44.140 --> 00:05:47.070
I wanna quit school. I don't wanna go anymore.

00:05:47.070 --> 00:05:50.110
There's no use complaining, you were elected.

00:05:50.110 --> 00:05:51.910
It's not fair.

00:05:51.910 --> 00:05:53.540
That's no excuse.

00:05:54.110 --> 00:05:56.880
The other girls are doing it.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:59.170
You can't be the only one who gets to have her own way.

00:05:59.970 --> 00:06:02.890
I know, but still...

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:37.120
I can't do this.

00:06:37.990 --> 00:06:40.900
I was just pushed into it.

00:06:40.900 --> 00:06:43.380
No sense sulking about it.

00:06:46.710 --> 00:06:49.870
You... You can talk...!

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:53.180
Seeing as we're here, how about we talk over dinner?

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.210
Dinner...?

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.440
Remember?

00:06:56.440 --> 00:06:58.560
This is supposed to be a give-and-take relationship.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:04.520
So? How come you're so unwilling to be on the party?

00:07:04.850 --> 00:07:07.940
'Cause I hate aliens.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:11.470
I don't wanna see them.
I don't wanna touch them.

00:07:11.470 --> 00:07:12.950
I don't wanna talk to them.

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:16.290
And I don't wanna be licked by them.

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:18.260
Oh, I get it.

00:07:18.260 --> 00:07:23.440
Well, you might not like it, but you can't get out of it.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:24.540
It's too late.

00:07:26.940 --> 00:07:29.770
You're a member of the party.

00:07:44.970 --> 00:07:49.260
Spring makes you feel like putting on perfume, huh?

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:51.280
Miss Kasumi?

00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.990
My older brother liked this fragrance too.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:08:00.950
<i>An alien has landed on the school's sport grounds.</i>

00:08:00.950 --> 00:08:05.920
<i>Students must not leave the building until the alien party have taken care of it.</i>

00:08:06.060 --> 00:08:10.580
<i>I repeat. Students must not leave the building.</i>

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.180
Gross.

00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:21.810
Okay girls, do your stuff.

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:52.710
Kasumi, I've got it!

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:58.220
Ootani!

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:48.440
Miss Ootani!

00:09:48.950 --> 00:09:50.360
You okay, Ootani?

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:06.130
Miss Ootani!

00:10:07.580 --> 00:10:11.270
Ootani? Ootani?

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.860
Pretty rough, huh, Yuri.

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:44.790
I wanna quit the alien party. I'm not suited for it.

00:10:45.630 --> 00:10:47.000
Yuri...

00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:50.180
Listen, Miss Ootani.

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:52.500
If you keep saying, "I'm scared, I'm scared",

00:10:52.500 --> 00:10:58.020
the Borg will take it upon itself to kill the alien in order to protect you.

00:10:58.020 --> 00:11:00.930
They may be aliens, but we must respect their lives.

00:11:04.040 --> 00:11:06.170
Hurry up, or you'll be left behind.

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:08.930
Oh... Kawamura!

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:14.740
Wh-what...?

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:16.860
No chance.

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:20.510
But, I haven't even asked you yet...

00:11:21.310 --> 00:11:21.860
What is it?

00:11:22.440 --> 00:11:25.550
Please help me, Kawamura.

00:11:25.550 --> 00:11:26.290
No.

00:11:28.230 --> 00:11:31.210
I don't want to be the nice person anymore.

00:11:35.130 --> 00:11:39.630
I was the class president from first grade onwards.

00:11:41.330 --> 00:11:43.660
Being class president sucks.

00:11:43.660 --> 00:11:45.530
All you do is meddling into other people's affairs.

00:11:45.530 --> 00:11:47.310
And you even have to be responsible for what they do.

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:53.410
All the things nobody else wants to do are left to you.

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:55.710
That's why I took this position now.

00:11:55.710 --> 00:11:59.710
So nobody can tell me to be the class president anymore.

00:11:59.710 --> 00:12:04.010
So don't you start leaning on me now!

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:31.560
You should have helped her.

00:12:36.860 --> 00:12:40.730
Kumi, that's what you're good at.

00:12:49.920 --> 00:12:51.410
Kumi!

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:56.840
I'm going to lie down for a bit. Wake me up in three hours.

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:58.960
Yeah, okay.

00:13:00.360 --> 00:13:05.290
I think you and Yuri would make a good pair.

00:13:05.290 --> 00:13:07.970
Don't go pairing me up.

00:13:14.300 --> 00:13:16.440
I wonder if I'm jealous of her...?

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:34.410
Miss Hisakawa...?

00:13:34.410 --> 00:13:37.580
How's Yuri doing at school?

00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:41.380
She's been whining about having a position in some terrible party.

00:13:41.980 --> 00:13:44.050
She's so useless around the home,

00:13:44.050 --> 00:13:45.550
I wonder if she can do her duties at school.

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:49.730
Mum, I told you not to say anything stupid...!

00:13:49.730 --> 00:13:53.310
Well, I have to ask your teacher, otherwise I won't find out anything.

00:14:08.120 --> 00:14:12.200
She was four years old when her father died.

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:14.720
Since then, it's been just the two of us.

00:14:14.720 --> 00:14:18.220
She's turned into such an independent child.
Almost too independent.

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:20.170
I'm a bit worried about it, actually.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:23.760
Since I started elementary school,

00:14:23.760 --> 00:14:26.960
I started helping mum at her job as a writer.

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:31.630
With the word processing, doing research, and lately even the bookkeeping.

00:14:31.630 --> 00:14:33.930
I see.

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:46.780
I don't like to put too many restrictions on my children.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:50.610
I've allowed them to do anything they want up until now.

00:14:51.180 --> 00:14:53.950
However, and this is the key —

00:14:53.950 --> 00:14:57.070
I won't allow them to give up the effort halfway through.

00:14:57.070 --> 00:15:00.460
Uh... where is her older brother?

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:02.750
He's studying overseas.

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:09.840
This is for a piano recital I won.

00:15:09.840 --> 00:15:11.610
And a ballet competition.

00:15:11.610 --> 00:15:15.680
And this is for a robot simulation competition.

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:16.770
And that photo?

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:21.690
That's my older brother.

00:15:43.350 --> 00:15:46.000
Don't worry, children.

00:15:46.550 --> 00:15:50.720
The girls in the alien party will save us shortly.

00:16:02.940 --> 00:16:06.040
Hurry up, Yuri, or it'll leave.

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:07.650
Easier said than done.

00:16:13.900 --> 00:16:15.490
You missed.

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.510
Uh-oh! Now it's mad!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:36.800
Yuri?

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:45.870
Oh no! Oh no!

00:16:45.870 --> 00:16:48.190
Oh no!

00:16:48.360 --> 00:16:50.150
Want me to waste him too?!

00:16:51.080 --> 00:16:54.860
No, the teacher would get mad at me again.

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:10.800
Oh, I'm scared...! I'm scared!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:18.600
I'm scared! I'm scared!
I'm scared!

00:17:18.600 --> 00:17:21.430
I'm scared! I'm scared! I'm scared!

00:17:34.630 --> 00:17:36.920
Kawamura...!

00:17:51.580 --> 00:17:55.800
Kawamura...! Kawamura...!

00:17:55.800 --> 00:17:58.230
Kawamura...!

00:17:59.320 --> 00:18:01.510
— Oh, brother!

00:18:08.730 --> 00:18:10.190
You're too slow, Yuri!

00:18:24.110 --> 00:18:25.800
Slacking off, huh?

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:26.910
No, it's not like that!

00:18:27.470 --> 00:18:29.870
I'm just having a break...

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:32.900
Ta-da!

00:18:33.660 --> 00:18:35.130
I caught the fifth one.

00:18:35.420 --> 00:18:37.170
Unreal!

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:40.680
We'd better catch the last one, or we'll have to stay after school.

00:18:44.030 --> 00:18:47.680
Hey, how did you get stuck with this position?

00:18:48.210 --> 00:18:49.850
'Cause I like it.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:56.160
Then Kasumi Toomine asked to be in the alien party?

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.930
Wow!

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:59.740
It is unreal.

00:19:01.210 --> 00:19:07.120
Kasumi's cute, and from a rich family, and she's great at skating.

00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:10.680
If I were her, I wouldn't ask to be in the alien party.

00:19:10.680 --> 00:19:13.080
Me neither.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:18.600
Her marks are so good, she could make it into any junior high without having to be in the alien party.

00:19:18.600 --> 00:19:20.970
Keep it moving!

00:19:23.410 --> 00:19:26.510
60 cm.

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:28.100
53 cm.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:33.730
Uh... 146 cm!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:36.440
Great! I grew 5 cm!

00:19:36.440 --> 00:19:38.200
Hey, I just remembered.

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:41.540
My sister said that when she was in the junior school,

00:19:41.540 --> 00:19:45.210
girls in the alien party suddenly got taller too!

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:49.920
Guess that's what happens when you wear an alien on your head!

00:19:50.370 --> 00:19:53.220
Nah, I'm just kidding.

00:19:53.220 --> 00:19:54.580
Hey, stop that!

00:19:54.950 --> 00:19:56.450
You don't know how Yuri feels.

00:19:56.450 --> 00:19:57.920
I said I was just kidding.

00:19:57.920 --> 00:19:59.420
Well, it's still not very nice!

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:01.390
Especially 'cause you know Yuri doesn't want to be in the party!

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:04.340
You don't have to have a cow over it.

00:20:09.050 --> 00:20:13.020
I wonder what would happen if I always kept it on...?

00:20:28.670 --> 00:20:32.320
I envy you, wearing it all the time.

00:20:32.320 --> 00:20:33.000
What?!

00:20:37.250 --> 00:20:38.130
No way!

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:41.010
That's no good, Ootani.

00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:43.930
A Borg's life is as precious as that of human beings.

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:49.010
Teacher, Ootani hates Borgs.

00:20:53.800 --> 00:20:57.570
Kumi became a junior high school student.

00:20:57.570 --> 00:21:00.020
Want me to make you a junior high school student?

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:01.490
Huh?

00:21:01.490 --> 00:21:03.890
Down here.

00:21:07.240 --> 00:21:09.490
Found ya, Yuri!

00:21:12.010 --> 00:21:15.100
K-Kasumi...

00:21:17.400 --> 00:21:21.130
Hey, Kasumi? How come you joined the party?

00:21:21.300 --> 00:21:22.460
Nya!

00:21:37.720 --> 00:21:40.270
So? What did Kasumi say?

00:21:40.790 --> 00:21:41.730
She said, "Nya".

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:44.130
Not in the dream, I mean today!

00:21:44.130 --> 00:21:46.700
Oh, she said, "Because I like it."

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:50.780
You mean you want to become like Kasumi?

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:51.900
That won't happen.

00:21:51.900 --> 00:21:53.210
Why not?

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:56.460
'Cause she's got something we don't.

00:21:59.230 --> 00:22:00.210
And that is...?

00:22:00.550 --> 00:22:01.710
Ask her yourself.

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:06.130
Kasumi!

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:08.890
Kasumi!

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:11.430
Something I don't have...?

00:22:14.010 --> 00:22:15.520
I don't have...

00:22:16.210 --> 00:22:18.470
— That's...
— Surrender!

00:22:18.470 --> 00:22:19.560
That's...

00:22:19.770 --> 00:22:22.190
Is it the fact that she likes it?

00:22:24.940 --> 00:22:29.210
— Kasumi!
— Kasumi!

00:22:30.160 --> 00:22:31.280
Gotcha!

00:22:35.460 --> 00:22:36.580
Kasumi!

00:22:36.580 --> 00:22:37.960
Kasumi...

00:22:45.350 --> 00:22:47.590
A new record! Here's the sixth one!

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:51.200
Kasumi really has a talent for this.

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:55.840
We couldn't have done this. Not a chance.

00:23:00.720 --> 00:23:02.480
What a great sunset.

00:23:08.290 --> 00:23:12.620
In other words, we've all got our own strengths and weaknesses.

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:22.540
The problem is this girl.

00:23:24.410 --> 00:23:26.880
She's too average.

00:23:26.880 --> 00:23:32.410
She'll need to make tremendous efforts to deal with the problems.

00:23:40.730 --> 00:23:43.730
Now, let's see which girl it is this year!

00:23:45.470 --> 00:23:48.220
I can hardly wait.

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:11.630
Good, that's all.

00:24:12.080 --> 00:24:14.550
You did a good job today, Miss Ootani.

00:24:14.550 --> 00:24:15.640
Nice work.

00:24:16.040 --> 00:24:19.050
Thank you.

00:24:24.800 --> 00:24:26.730
Nice job.

00:24:27.000 --> 00:24:30.100
Miyu, you waited for me.

00:24:30.100 --> 00:24:33.630
I've got your bag. I'll walk you home.

00:24:35.060 --> 00:24:36.640
I've been thinking.

00:24:36.640 --> 00:24:39.160
I think I'm going to try and hang in there a little longer.

00:24:40.700 --> 00:24:41.660
Good.

00:24:42.240 --> 00:24:44.460
Hang on. I'll be right back.

00:25:14.450 --> 00:25:19.110
I was right, this really does suck!

00:25:19.700 --> 00:25:23.700
The End
Episode 1:
No. 9 Elementary School Alien Counter-Measure Party

