April 29. Sunny.
Preview

00:27:12.530 --> 00:27:12.900
Today no aliens landed, so I was happy.
Preview

00:27:12.900 --> 00:27:16.030
Today no aliens landed, so I was happy.

00:27:16.030 --> 00:27:18.530
I went shopping with Miyu.

00:27:18.530 --> 00:27:21.450
Kawamura was nice to me today.

00:27:21.450 --> 00:27:24.490
Toomine smelled nice.

00:27:24.490 --> 00:27:28.780
Miss Shionozaki was mad at me, 'cause I forgot my homework.

00:27:28.780 --> 00:27:31.310
I'm gonna try not to forget it anymore.

00:27:31.310 --> 00:27:35.000
Miyu had two hamburgers when we were out shopping.

00:27:35.000 --> 00:27:38.970
She said, "I just got my allowance."
